    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "ERA Downey McCarthy Auctioneers are delighted to present to the market this superbly positioned property within the heart of Douglas village set within a quiet cul-de-sac. This property offers convenience at your doorstep, being just a short walk from all essential and recreational amenities. \r\n\r\nAccommodation includes reception hallway, guest w.c, living room, and an open plan kitchen/dining area on the ground floor. Upstairs the property offers three spacious bedrooms and the main family bathroom."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The front of the property features a beautiful red brick façade and allows off street parking for two vehicles. \r\n\r\nThe rear of the property is fully enclosed with mature hedging and block built walls. The area has a spacious and maintenance free patio area."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Reception Hallway - 4.41m x 1.76m \r\nA solid wooden door with attractive stain glass panelling allows access into the reception hallway. The bright hallway has new herringbone vinyl flooring, neutral décor, one large radiator, one centre light piece, and under stair storage.\r\n\r\nGuest W.C - 1.44m x 0.76m \r\nThe guest w.c features a two piece suite, one centre light piece, and access to the alarm panel.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 4.21m x 3.16m \r\nThe main living room has newly fitted carpet flooring, one large window to the front of the property, neutral décor, one centre light piece, one radiator, and four power points. \r\n\r\nOpen Plan Kitchen/Dining - 3.91m x 5.06m \r\nA spacious and bright kitchen/dining area has a large window overlooking the rear yard and a door with frosted glass panelling allowing access to same, flooding the room with natural light. The room has new herringbone vinyl flooring, \n\nThe kitchen features solid fitted units at eye and floor level with worktop counter and tile splashback. The area has a stainless steel sink, space for an oven, space for an under counter fried, plumbing for a washing machine, one centre light piece, five power points, and access to the gas boiler.\n\nThe dining area/lounge has a red brick fireplace, four power points, and one large radiator.\r\n\r\nStairs and Landing - 2.97m x 1.83m \r\nThe stairs and landing are fitted with new carpet flooring throughout. At the top of the landing there is one centre light piece, and access to the attic.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.15m x 2.64m \r\nThis spacious double bedroom has one window to the front of the property, newly fitted carpet flooring, neutral décor, built-in wardrobes with vanity unit, one centre light piece, one radiator, and four power points. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.0m x 3.2m \r\nAnother spacious double bedroom has one window to the rear of the property, newly fitted carpet flooring, neutral décor, built-in wardrobes with vanity unit, one centre light piece, one radiator, and four power points. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.82m x 2.35m \r\nThis bedroom has one window to the front, newly fitted carpet flooring, neutral décor, built-in wardrobes, one centre light piece, one radiator, and four power points. \r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.49m x 1.85m \r\nThe main family bathroom features a four piece suite including a Triton T90 electric shower fitted over the bath. The room has vinyl flooring, tile splashback, one frosted window to the rear, one centre light piece, one radiator, and access to the hot press. \r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Approx. 85.62 Sq. M. / 922 Sq. Ft.\r\nBuilt in 1979\r\nBER C\r\nThree bedrooms\r\nNewly fitted carpet flooring\r\nEnclosed rear yard\r\nOff street parking for two vehicles\r\nSuperb location in the heart of Douglas Village \r\nClose to all amenities"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
